> can read 100s of ascension posts that at least sound like fun. And
> some that were a chore of course.

You can turn Nethack into a chore through a number of methods, most of 
which involve ridiculous overpreparation and focusing on the wrong things
in the pursuit of winning.  But that takes player intent; it's not
inherently a part of the game, that it _has_ to be boring.

